Anybody know is it's normal for the Asus P4PE to not reveal any
thermal/fan/ec/power info?

The only info I can get out of it is that it has a power button, and the
processor info is wrong.

This board is HT-capable, but my single CPU is not dual-core, and yet the
ACPI system thinks I have two CPU's (but /proc/cpuinfo shows only one).

I would love to get thermal_zone and fan info from this board if anybody
knows how.

I have tried all available BIOSes; 1001, 1002, and each beta 1003 up to the
